  "id": "slack-app-temporal-workflows-and-activities",
  "title": "Slack app Temporal workflows and activities",
  "kind": "location",
  "answers": [
    "Where are Slack Temporal workflows defined?",
    "Where are slack_app activities registered?"
  ],
  "body": "- Workflows in `posthog/temporal/ai/slack_app/`: `slack_app_mention.py:SlackAppMentionWorkflow` (`slack-app-mention`), `posthog_code_slack_mention.py:PostHogCodeSlackMentionWorkflow`, `posthog_code_slack_mention_command.py:PostHogCodeSlackMentionCommandWorkflow`, `slack_app_fork.py:SlackAppForkThreadWorkflow`, `posthog_slack_inbox_onboarding.py:PostHogSlackInboxOnboardingWorkflow`. Types in `types.py`.\n- Activities live in `activities/` (`fork.py`, `onboarding.py`, `billing.py`, `classifiers.py`, `thread.py`, ...) and are re-exported from `activities/__init__.py`.\n- Registration: `posthog/temporal/ai/__init__.py` (workflows + `SLACK_APP_ACTIVITIES`). New workflow/activity must be added there.",
